A 45-year-old Italian woman (use Elena Higgsfield reference) sitting on the edge of her bed in soft morning light, holding her smartphone showing the alarm clock app on screen with "06:00" visible (or "07:00" - the screen should clearly show an alarm time). Her expression: direct knowing slight smile - she's about to say something honest. She wears soft sleepwear (simple t-shirt, comfortable). Bedroom in clean modern Italian style with bedside table, simple lamp.

